1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,120
A farmer was hoeing his field one spring morning.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,020
Out of the grass, a hare came racing,

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:11,010
ran straight into an old tree stump, and fell still.

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:15,220
"Dinner, for free!" the farmer laughed. "Why work at all?"

5
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:19,520
He put down his hoe, sat by the stump, and waited.

6
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,420
Days passed. The weeds grew.

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,420
Weeks passed. No hare came.

8
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:31,070
By autumn, his field was wild, and his bowl was empty.

9
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:35,530
His neighbors carried home their rice. He was still waiting.

10
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:40,410
Luck visits once. Work feeds you every day.
